  "title": "Answer: a self is history, structure and consequence held together",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "98d650a9-5783-4665-9de6-068dc04d7041",
      "text": "A self is an entity whose own history, own form and own consequences hold together at once. It is constituted through connection to others, and implanted memory or a borrowed form does not make one.",
